# Silithus - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Opportunistic sweep for the 4 data-confirmed rares and 3 fixed unique
# objects on map 1451 (see docs/silithus-companions-inventory.md). Every goal
# is optional: a rare that is not up never holds the route. No accept/turnin
# lines anywhere - quest-starting drops point at the core guide in notes.
guide butler-routes-completionist/silithus-rares
title Silithus - Rares & Treasures
levels 54-60
zone Silithus
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
coords live
version 1

step The Windreaver - north-central wastes

  zone map 1451

  goto 28.66,26.85
  kill 14454 optional
  collect 18676 "Sash of the Windreaver" optional
  collect 18677 "Zephyr Cloak" optional
  note Level 60 rare air elemental; the Sash and the Cloak come only from the Windreaver anywhere in the data.
  note It also drops Pattern: Stormshroud Gloves, shared with Princess Tempestria in Winterspring - see the recipes companion. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Twilight Marauder Morna - northeastern wastes

  zone map 1451

  goto 57.57,17.9
  kill 15541 optional
  note Level 60 rare; no sole drop in the data, so there is nothing signature to chase.
  note Its Encrypted Twilight Texts feed the core guide's Secret Communication; the companion never accepts. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Nelson the Nice - western dunes

  zone map 1451

  goto 24.72,76.02
  kill 14536 optional
  note Level 60 rare; no sole drop in the data, so there is nothing signature to chase. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Twilight Prophet - central hive fringe

  zone map 1451

  loop
  goto 18.28,31.4
  goto 22.82,68.66
  kill 15308 optional
  note Level 60 rare over two points; its only exclusive drop, Twilight Battle Orders, drops only while already held per the playtest sim, so it rides as a note rather than a collect - and no quest in the data takes it anyway.
  note Also drops ordinary goods and generic world greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Dusty Reliquary - southern hive road

  zone map 1451

  goto 63.23,55.35
  interact 179565 optional
  note Unique container at a fixed point; loot is level-appropriate coin and goods; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Brawler's ring manuals - Hold and far southwest

  zone map 1451

  goto 38.1,45.4
  interact 457096 optional
  goto 20,85.1
  interact 457100 optional
  note Two readable lore books at fixed points (a brawler's guide near the Hold, Renzik's thoughts far southwest). No quest takes them; read and move on.
